# Optional skills
#
# One skill directory name per line. Listed skills are installed by the `all`
# skill set and skipped by `core`. Anything not listed here is core and is
# always installed, so a new skill is never silently dropped.
#
# Keep vendored third-party skills here: they are domain rule sets, useful on a
# React machine and dead weight on one that never touches React.

vercel-react-best-practices
vercel-composition-patterns
